{
 "bpm": 72,
 "period": 0.8333333333333334,
 "vo": [
  {
   "t": 0.6,
   "end": 2.431,
   "text": "Fourteen years had passed.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p00.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 3.5,
   "end": 8.372,
   "text": "Fourteen years of exile, sacrifice, pain... and an unwavering promise.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p01.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 9.0,
   "end": 11.652,
   "text": "But tonight, Ayodhya was waiting for its king.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p02.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 12.9,
   "end": 16.253,
   "text": "After defeating Ravana and fulfilling his destiny,",
   "file": "audio/vo/p03.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 16.8,
   "end": 19.081,
   "text": "Lord Ram began his journey home,",
   "file": "audio/vo/p04.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 19.3,
   "end": 21.576,
   "text": "accompanied by Sita and Lakshman.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p05.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 22.5,
   "end": 25.068,
   "text": "When the people heard that Ram was returning,",
   "file": "audio/vo/p06.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 25.3,
   "end": 27.914,
   "text": "the entire kingdom prepared to welcome him.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p07.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 28.25,
   "end": 31.147,
   "text": "Every home became a place of celebration.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p08.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 32.5,
   "end": 34.642,
   "text": "But the diya was more than a lamp.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p09.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 35.0,
   "end": 37.283,
   "text": "It represented the light of knowledge,",
   "file": "audio/vo/p10.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 37.5,
   "end": 38.894,
   "text": "the strength of hope,",
   "file": "audio/vo/p11.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 39.15,
   "end": 41.397,
   "text": "and the victory of good over evil.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p12.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 42.5,
   "end": 46.192,
   "text": "And then, the moment Ayodhya had waited for finally arrived.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p13.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 47.5,
   "end": 49.645,
   "text": "Their beloved Ram had returned.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p14.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 52.5,
   "end": 54.543,
   "text": "One lamp became thousands.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p15.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 55.0,
   "end": 56.776,
   "text": "Darkness surrendered to light.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p16.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 58.5,
   "end": 63.243,
   "text": "And Ayodhya transformed into a celebration that would live for generations.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p17.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 65.0,
   "end": 67.492,
   "text": "It was not merely the return of a king.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p18.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 68.0,
   "end": 72.03,
   "text": "It was the reunion of a family, the fulfillment of a promise,",
   "file": "audio/vo/p19.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 72.3,
   "end": 74.509,
   "text": "and the restoration of righteousness.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p20.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 75.8,
   "end": 78.905,
   "text": "That is why Diwali is more than a celebration.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p21.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 79.3,
   "end": 82.542,
   "text": "It reminds us that even after the longest darkness,",
   "file": "audio/vo/p22.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 82.7,
   "end": 85.973,
   "text": "truth, courage and dharma can guide us towards light.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p23.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 87.0,
   "end": 90.285,
   "text": "Light is not just something we place outside our homes.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p24.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 91.0,
   "end": 94.042,
   "text": "It is something we must keep alive within ourselves.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p25.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 95.5,
   "end": 100.211,
   "text": "From that legendary night, the lights of Diwali became a timeless reminder:",
   "file": "audio/vo/p26.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 100.8,
   "end": 104.338,
   "text": "darkness may surround us, but it never has to define us.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p27.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 107.0,
   "end": 110.106,
   "text": "May the light of Shri Ram illuminate every heart.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p28.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 110.5,
   "end": 113.594,
   "text": "Wishing you and your family a blessed Badi Diwali.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p29.wav"
  },
  {
   "t": 114.2,
   "end": 115.709,
   "text": "Jai Shri Ram.",
   "file": "audio/vo/p30.wav"
  }
 ],
